      * Src-fragment necessary to run F791ERR0-Error-Handling routines. 00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * Documentation: see FPO.MASTF.COPY(R791ERR0).                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      *################################################################*00160000
       Z100-Error-Initialize             Section.                       00170000
      *                                                                 00180000
      * This section is used for initializing all Error information.    00190002
      *                                                                 00200002
           Set   R791ERR0-Version        To    True                     00210014
           Set   R791ERR0-In-Initialize  To    True                     00220014
           Move  WC-Program-ID           To    R791ERR0-In-Module-ID    00230014
      *                                                                 00240000
           Perform ZSYS-Error-System-Exit                               00250006
      *                                                                 00260001
           Call  'F791ERR0'              Using R791ERR0-Error-Handling  00270000
           End-Call                                                     00280000
      *                                                                 00290000
      * We will not do a goback in this section.                        00300011
      *                                                                 00310011
           .                                                            00320000
      *################################################################*00330003
       Z600-Error-Handling               Section.                       00340000
      *                                                                 00350000
      * This section is used when you want to create a new message.     00360002
      *                                                                 00370002
           Set   R791ERR0-Version        To    True                     00380000
           Set   R791ERR0-In-Error-Handling                             00390000
                                         To    True                     00400000
           Move  WC-Program-ID           To    R791ERR0-In-Module-ID    00410000
      *                                                                 00420000
           Perform ZSYS-Error-System-Exit                               00430006
      *                                                                 00440001
                                                                        00450007
           Call  'F791ERR0'              Using R791ERR0-Error-Handling  00460000
           End-Call                                                     00470000
      *                                                                 00480000
           Goback                                                       00490000
           .                                                            00500000
      *################################################################*00510000
       Z800-Call-Trace                   Section.                       00520000
      *                                                                 00530000
      * This section is used when you want to keep the message returned 00540002
      * from a subprogram.                                              00550002
      *                                                                 00560002
           Set   R791ERR0-Version        To    True                     00570000
           Set   R791ERR0-In-Call-Trace  To    True                     00580000
           Move  WC-Program-ID           To    R791ERR0-In-Module-ID    00590000
      *                                                                 00600000
           Perform ZSYS-Error-System-Exit                               00610006
      *                                                                 00620001
           Call  'F791ERR0'              Using R791ERR0-Error-Handling  00630000
           End-Call                                                     00640000
      *                                                                 00650000
           Goback                                                       00660000
           .                                                            00670000
      *################################################################*00680012
       Z900-Request-Info                 Section.                       00690012
      *                                                                 00700012
      * This section is used for fetching message- and trace-info.      00710012
      *                                                                 00720012
           Set   R791ERR0-Version        To    True                     00730012
           Set   R791ERR0-In-Request-Info                               00740012
                                         To    True                     00750012
      *                                                                 00760012
           Call  'F791ERR0'              Using R791ERR0-Error-Handling  00770012
           End-Call                                                     00780012
      *                                                                 00790012
      * We will not do a goback in this section.                        00800012
      *                                                                 00810012
           .                                                            00820012
      *################################################################*00830013
       ZA00-Add-User-Message             Section.                       00840013
      *                                                                 00850013
      * This section is used to add a user-oriented error message.      00860013
      *                                                                 00870013
           Set   R791ERR0-Version        To    True                     00880013
           Set   R791ERR0-In-Add-User-Message                           00890013
                                         To    True                     00900013
           Move  WC-Program-ID           To    R791ERR0-In-Module-ID    00910013
      *                                                                 00920013
           Perform ZSYS-Error-System-Exit                               00930013
      *                                                                 00940013
           Call  'F791ERR0'              Using R791ERR0-Error-Handling  00950013
           End-Call                                                     00960013
      *                                                                 00970013
      * We will not do a goback in this section.                        00980013
      *                                                                 00990013
           .                                                            01000013
